     1	<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 1300 530" width="1300" height="530" font-family="Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" role="img" aria-labelledby="t d">
     2	<title id="t">One-to-one or many-to-one</title>
     3	<desc id="d">Left: shifting the number toward the referral is one-to-one within each referral. Right: a cap under the high-risk referral merges many blind values into one reported value. Schematic.</desc>
